OL,3,GNEWSAMan,18, jailed for 12 years for
OL,4,Arape and harrasment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for a total of 12
OL,7,Fyears after he was convicted of rape,
OL,8,Falongside multiple other offences -
OL,9,Fincluding harassment and exposure.
OL,11,FMike Loveridge, of Newbury Road,
OL,12,FDidcot, Oxfordshire, was found guilty
OL,13,Fof three counts of rape in relation to
OL,14,Fone victim, following a trial at High
OL,15,FWycombe Magistrates' Court in
OL,16,FSeptember.
OL,18,FThe 18-year-old was also convicted for
OL,19,Fadditional offences, including
OL,20,Fharassment, committed against other
OL,21,Fvictims between April and May 2026.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
