OL,4,Arape and harrasment
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring a hearing at Oxford Crown Court
OL,7,Fon 29 October, Loveridge was sentenced
OL,8,Fto eight years in prison with a four
OL,9,Fyear extension period.
